  description: 'When your opponent activates a monster effect, or a Normal Spell/Trap
    Card: Choose 3 Spells/Traps with different names from your Deck and 1 monster
    in your Main Monster Zone that mentions "Light and Darkness Ritual". Special
    Summon the Spells/Traps as Normal Monsters (Spellcaster/DARK/Level 8/ATK 0/DEF
    0) in face-down Defense Position (their names become "Chaos Magical Hats" even
    while face-down), Set the chosen monster if it is face-up, and shuffle them on
    the field. Then your opponent''s activated effect becomes "Destroy 1 monster
    your opponent controls in face-down Defense Position".'
